{
 "_about": "Weapon rolls take effect (the owner, 2026-10-29: \"let's fix!\", the same percentages). Recoil (prop 115; 2080..2084 -2..-10 %, defect 3060 +10 %): their twelve modifiers targeted recoil/*_first_shoot_* and *_queue_shoot_* keys no 0.26g weapon has, so find_modifier_target 0x2F1430 found nothing and the cook skipped them (0x2F1ABF); now six, one per key the recoil loader 0x331840 reads (min/max_top, min/max_left, min/max_right_recoil), type 2, base x max(0, 1 + sum) (0x358010; an int becomes a float first), so -10 % is 0.9 x the kick. Aim time (prop 102; 2070..2074 -2..-10 %): parameters/aim_time_modifier type 1 is a player modifier a weapon never registers (its inventory vtable slot 0x1AF330 is a bare ret); now parameters/aim_time (weapon+0x5F8, read at 0x30AC7E) type 2. Defects and modifications keep their ids, values, cards and lobby_info. Changes the simulation.",
